{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/reviews/id1146814296"}, "name":{"label":"L-S1"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2024-01-23T17:41:52-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"3"}, "im:version":{"label":"3.3.1"}, "id":{"label":"10856825823"}, "title":{"label":"Disappointed"}, "content":{"label":"Appears user friendly, features seem practical and useful. Sadly the basic function of repeating certain tasks daily is only available on the pro subscription. Whilst the monthly fee seems reasonable and it fully understandable for there to be a charge for the AI functionality etc. the basic of repeating tasks is disappointing.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/review?id=1499198946&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/reviews/id401498551"}, "name":{"label":"Therese tautho"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2024-01-22T14:06:25-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"3.3.1"}, "id":{"label":"10852635393"}, "title":{"label":"Already been so helpful! Love it so much"}, "content":{"label":"Had this app for a day and it already has been so helpful to me! It gives me a clear view of what I want to get done and how my day will roughly look like! It’s quit therapeutic in a way and I love it when everything is ticked off! Love the layout too as you can choose if u want to be more minimalistic or have the full layout, so happy I found this!", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/review?id=1499198946&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/reviews/id1592699446"}, "name":{"label":"Georgie1979"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2024-01-22T11:03:08-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"3.3.1"}, "id":{"label":"10852165293"}, "title":{"label":"Brilliant!"}, "content":{"label":"I have tried a lot of different productivity apps but this one fits my needs the best. The design is aesthetically great and it is really simple to use. I love the fact I can customize it with a range of icons and colors. I actually really look forward to opening it up each morning- there’s not many productivity apps I can say that about. Planning my time more effectively was always something I knew I should do but I always struggled with it and it felt like a chore…Structured is basically helping me to nail this keystone habit…I highly recommend it.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/review?id=1499198946&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/reviews/id176384526"}, "name":{"label":"charlotte.plus2"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2024-01-21T04:24:14-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"3.3.1"}, "id":{"label":"10847059481"}, "title":{"label":"Honestly the best to do app!"}, "content":{"label":"Everything you need without needing to over complicate things! The part I love the most is I get notifications to my watch to remind me when to do things. I also love that it links to my calendar so it automatically adds events/appointments without me needing to do add it manually! \nAt the end of every day I’ll plan out my activities for the next day but also have regular daily tasks added automatically too! \nThis is the perfect app for anyone who struggles with keeping on top of tasks or needs little reminders.\n\nMy suggestions for the future if possible would be to add a family feature that can link your account with others in the family. I’d love to be able to use this with my daughters to help them remember certain lessons, chores/tasks they need to complete. Would be a real game changer for our family", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/review?id=1499198946&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
