{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/reviews/id1417000352"}, "name":{"label":"🤪poo"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2024-01-03T13:35:40-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"2"}, "im:version":{"label":"3.3.1"}, "id":{"label":"10780372225"}, "title":{"label":"not very good"}, "content":{"label":"i downloaded this app to see if it would help me but it really doesn’t. I find that the tasks which i am setting times in are not taking that amount of time, and by the time i’m done with one task, the next one is already finished . This app also has an option to set the time on your own but as i was trying to do my school times, each time i tried to set the second one to 3:00, it was scrolling the other one to 3:00 and vice versa with the other. So i personally think that this app isn’t the greatest and it wasn’t worth it.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/review?id=1499198946&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
