{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/reviews/id174064550"}, "name":{"label":"Donna-86"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2023-12-29T16:24:12-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"3.3.1"}, "id":{"label":"10760701242"}, "title":{"label":"Perfect App for Organising"}, "content":{"label":"I’m a true organiser and love to plan my days out in advance. I’ve tried many apps like this one but they all failed on something or other, or wasn’t to my liking. \n\nUntil Structured!\n\nAll my organisational needs and wants were within this perfectly constructed app. Not only is it appealing to the eye in a simplistic yet beautiful layout, it’s easy to add a task, easy to navigate the app and has amazing features that make my routine-thriving heart happy. Adding Subtasks within a task is probably my favour feature, as well as the plethora of icons available. And to top it all off for such an outstanding app, the price is spot on! 👌🏼 \n\nI couldn’t ask for a better app to help me structure my day. Thank you Structured team for your incredible work on a flawless app 🤍", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/review?id=1499198946&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
